---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: RFA
mainClass: "page page--experience"
featuredProjects:
- CAVITATION
- HEI
- MACHINING
---


<section class="page-hero" style="--hero-img: url('/assets/images/experience/rfa/s1_engine_bay.jpg');">
    <div class="page-hero__overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="container page-hero__inner">
        <p class="page-hero__kicker">Internship</p>
        <h1 class="page-hero__title">Rocket Factory Augsburg AG</h1>
        <p class="page-hero__sub">Propulsion Department • 2025 • Augsburg, DE</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="page-disclosure" aria-labelledby="rfa-disclosure-title">
    <div class="container page-disclosure__inner">
        <p class="page-disclosure__label" id="rfa-disclosure-title">Disclosure</p>
        <p class="page-disclosure__text">
            Non-Disclosure Agreement: I only share non-proprietary information regarding my work at RFA.
            Images and media shown here are publicly available.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="story">
    <div class="container story__grid">

        <figure class="media media--16x9">
            <video class="media__el" controls playsinline preload="metadata"
                poster="/assets/images/experience/rfa/video_cover.png">
                <source
                    src="/assets/images/experience/rfa/helix_test.mp4"
                    type="video/mp4">
            </video>
        </figure>


        <div class="story__content">
            <h2 class="story__title">Building Rockets Like Cars</h2>
            <p class="story__text">
                Rocket Factory Augsburg AG is one of the first commercial European companies developing orbital
                class launcher capable of delivering variety of payloads to different orbits.
            </p>
            <p class="story__text">
                Its uniqueness stands in successful full in-house development of <strong>Europe's first oxygen-rich
                staged combustion (ORSC) engine</strong> called HELIX capable of delivering roughly 100kN of thrust.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="story story--reverse">
    <div class="container story__grid">

        <figure class="media media--16x9">
            {% img "assets/images/experience/rfa/ignition.png", "Engine ignition" %}

        </figure>


        <div class="story__content">
            <h2 class="story__title">My Work</h2>
            <p class="story__text">
                As part of the propulsion R&D team, I contributed to fluid mechanics analysis for HELIX refinement,
                specifically cavitation research on component testing.
            </p>
            <p class="story__text">
                Key projects I have been involved in include:
            </p>
            <div class="education-text-bullets">
              <ul>
                <li>Iterations of system design</li>
                <li>Cavitation research of propellant/ignition feed system</li>
                <li>Development of test rigs for component testing</li>
                <li>Research based empirical data analysis.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <p class="story__text">
                A non-sensitive view of that research is available as a dedicated thesis project page.
            </p>
            <a href="/cavitation/" class="story__link">Orifice cavitation research</a>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<section class="story">
    <div class="container story__grid">

        <figure class="media media--4x3">
            {% img "assets/images/experience/rfa/helix_production.jpg", "Engine production" %}
        </figure>


        <div class="story__content">
            <h2 class="story__title">From design to real production</h2>
            <p class="story__text">
                Involved in the complete development cycle, from defining requirements and
                design, through validation testing, to final assembly.
            </p>
            <p class="story__text">
                Even as an intern, I had the opportunity to see my work implemented
                in real production. The company’s culture is built on trust — interns are given full
                responsibility for their projects, supported by strong technical supervision.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="related">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="related__head">
            <h1 class="related__title">Related Projects</h1>
            <p class="logo-band__label">More work in propulsion, testing, data processing…</p>
        </div>
         <div class="projects__carousel" aria-label="Projects carousel">
      <div class="projects__grid" id="projectsGrid">
        {% for id in featuredProjects %}
          {% set p = projects[id] %}
          {% if p %}
            {% include "components/project-card.njk" %}
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <div class="projects__dots" aria-label="Project navigation"></div>
    </div>
    </div>
</section>
